{
  "duration": 51.085,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w01",
      "text": "Every evening, Anaya waited at the window.",
      "start": 0.3,
      "end": 3.85
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w02",
      "text": "She was waiting for her father.",
      "start": 3.91,
      "end": 6.56
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w03",
      "text": "He had gone far away to work. One more cross on the calendar.",
      "start": 6.8,
      "end": 11.475
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w04",
      "text": "Dinner was quieter now.",
      "start": 11.6,
      "end": 14.15
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w05",
      "text": "So she kept his photograph close.",
      "start": 14.6,
      "end": 17.625
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w06",
      "text": "Some nights, she fell asleep by the door.",
      "start": 18.0,
      "end": 21.275
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w07",
      "text": "And when it rained, she wondered if he was cold.",
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 25.575
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w08",
      "text": "She drew him a picture. Four people, one house.",
      "start": 26.2,
      "end": 29.975
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w08",
      "text": "Two hundred and eleven days.",
      "start": 30.6,
      "end": 33.5
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w09",
      "text": "Then one morning, she heard a sound at the gate.",
      "start": 33.6,
      "end": 37.175
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w09",
      "text": "But it wasn't him.",
      "start": 37.8,
      "end": 39.95
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w11",
      "text": "It was a letter.",
      "start": 40.2,
      "end": 42.225
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w11",
      "text": "Papa is coming home. In ten days.",
      "start": 42.6,
      "end": 46.1
    },
    {
      "id": "l14",
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "w10c",
      "text": "Ten days. And forty-two rupees.",
      "start": 46.6,
      "end": 49.825
    }
  ]
}